WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.551 --> 00:00:12.865
Sign in as the platform admin.

2
00:00:12.965 --> 00:00:18.935
Businesses lists every business on the platform with its plan, status, sales and renewal date.

3
00:00:19.035 --> 00:00:24.292
The Health column scores each business from recent sales, subscription and setup.

4
00:00:24.392 --> 00:00:28.328
Type part of a name in the search box to narrow the list.

5
00:00:28.429 --> 00:00:32.913
Only matching businesses stay. Clear the box to see them all again.

6
00:00:33.013 --> 00:00:37.444
View opens the profile of one business. Here is FreshMart Grocers.

7
00:00:37.544 --> 00:00:42.414
The top cards give its status, plan, sales in the last 30 days and health.

8
00:00:42.514 --> 00:00:48.595
Below are its details, the owner, and the subscription: plan, billing interval and renewal date.

9
00:00:48.695 --> 00:00:54.941
Plan usage compares what the business uses with its plan limits, such as team members and branches.

10
00:00:55.041 --> 00:00:59.361
Further down are its branches, its team and its recent invoices.

11
00:00:59.462 --> 00:01:03.820
Manage is where you change a business. Scroll up and click it.

12
00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:10.225
Set the plan, the status, the billing interval and the renewal date. We will not save anything here.

13
00:01:10.325 --> 00:01:16.075
Special limits let you give one business more branches, members or features than its plan.

14
00:01:16.175 --> 00:01:22.256
Further down you can record a manual payment, for example a bank transfer, and see the invoices.

15
00:01:22.356 --> 00:01:29.151
For support, Open as owner signs you in as the business owner. Add a reason, and everything you do is logged.

16
00:01:29.251 --> 00:01:33.846
That is businesses. Cancel leaves the page without changing anything.
